{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/236167-the-wicked-the-divine","id":236167,"title":"The Wicked + The Divine","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-20T21:33:54-07:00","id":236167,"title":"The Wicked + The Divine","content":"If you're looking for some Scion inspiration, do yourself a solid and check out <b>The Wicked + The Divine</b> by the comics dream team of Jamie McKelvie, Kieron Gillen, and Matt Wilson. Every 90 years twelve gods come to Earth as 17-year-olds. They live for two years, and are loved, but then they all die. This Recurrence has happened now, and the godlings have decided they want to be popstars and make you cream your pants in ecstasy in the front row.<br /> <br /> This is the same team that brought us indie comics/music darling <b>Phonogram</b> and more recently a stint on <b>Young Avengers</b> (which I desperately need to check out). There are tons of little tidbits for the comparative mythologist in all of us, plus the stunning, clean lines and colors of the art team. Issue 3 just came out! Go to the comic shop!<br /> <br /> Go now!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts